      "renderedContent": "\n<section class=\"relative w-full h-[40vh] md:h-[50vh] overflow-hidden bg-zinc-900\">\n    <!-- Breadcrumb Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"absolute top-8 left-0 w-full z-30\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-8 md:px-20\">\n            <nav class=\"reveal flex items-center gap-3 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest-xl uppercase text-white/40\">\n                <a href=\"project.html\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Project</a>\n                <span class=\"opacity-30\">&gt;</span>\n                <span class=\"text-white/80\">Animama Systems</span>\n            </nav>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\">\n        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618005182384-a83a8bd57fbe?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=2400\" alt=\"Project Feature\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80 scale-105 transition-transform duration-[10s] hover:scale-100\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/40 via-transparent to-black/60 z-10\"></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"relative z-20 h-full max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-8 md:px-20 flex flex-col justify-end pb-12\">\n        <div class=\"reveal\">\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.4em] text-white/60 uppercase mb-4 block\">Case Study / 01</span>\n            <h1 class=\"font-heading text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[6vw] font-bold text-white tracking-ultra-tight uppercase leading-none\">\n                ANIMAMA <br> SYSTEMS\n            </h1>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n"
