      "props": {},
      "children": {},
      "canvas": null,
      "renderedContent": "\n<section class=\"pb-32 md:pb-48\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:gap-8\">\n            <div class=\"reveal rounded-[2rem] md:rounded-[3rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl aspect-[4/5] md:aspect-square bg-gray-100 dark:bg-zinc-900\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550745165-9bc0b252726f?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" alt=\"Process View\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"reveal delay-100 rounded-[2rem] md:rounded-[3rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl aspect-[4/5] md:aspect-square bg-gray-100 dark:bg-zinc-900\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558655146-d09347e92766?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" alt=\"Interface Detail\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"md:col-span-2 reveal delay-200 rounded-[2rem] md:rounded-[3rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl aspect-video bg-gray-100 dark:bg-zinc-900\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=2400\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" alt=\"Final Result Wide\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "instance-1774388344445-shgb690no",
      "order": 5,
      "type": "partial",
      "partial": "project-details/detail_body.html",
      "componentPath": "project-details/detail_body.html",
      "name": "detail_body",
      "props": {},
      "children": {},
      "canvas": null,
      "renderedContent": "\n<section class=\"py-24 md:py-32 bg-white dark:bg-[#0a0a0a]\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-8 md:px-20\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 lg:gap-24\">\n            <!-- Sidebar label -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-4 reveal\">\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest-xl uppercase text-gray-400 block mb-8\">Deep Dive</span>\n                <h3 class=\"font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight leading-none\">Technical <br> Foundations &amp; <br> Methodology</h3>\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- Long-form content body -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-8 space-y-12 reveal delay-100\">\n                <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\">01 / The Challenge</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-light leading-relaxed\">\n                        Animation has historically been gated by the steep learning curve of keyframe manipulation and curve editing. Our primary objective was to democratize this process without sacrificing the fidelity that professional studios require. The friction points we identified were primarily centered around the disconnect between an artist's initial sketch and the rigid rigging required for movement.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\">02 / The Solution</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-light leading-relaxed\">\n                        We developed a proprietary \"latent-motion\" engine that interprets line-weight and gesture intent. By utilizing a hybrid transformer model, Animama can predict in-between frames that respect the stylistic idiosyncrasies of the creator. This allows for a workflow where the artist acts more like a conductor, guiding the AI through a series of natural language prompts and spatial markers rather than manual coordinate entry.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\">03 / The Impact</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-light leading-relaxed\">\n                        The deployment of this system at Aether Digital resulted in a significant paradigm shift. Production cycles for short-form character content were reduced from weeks to days. Furthermore, the accessible interface allowed design-focused members of the team to contribute to motion projects directly, breaking down silos between the static design and animation departments.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n"
    },
